flowchart TD
    Contact[/contato/] --> ContactApi[/api/contact/]
    ContactApi --> ContactEmail[Send contact email]

    Hero[/hero quote/] --> HeroApi[/api/orcamentos/]
    HeroApi --> HeroEmail[Send quote email]

    Quote[/orcamento/] --> QuoteApi[/api/quotes/]
    QuoteApi --> QuoteEmail[Send quote email]

    AdminBoleto[Admin sends boleto] --> BoletoApi[/api/admin/quotes/[id]/send-boleto/]
    BoletoApi --> BoletoEmail[Send boleto email]

    AdminAdjust[Admin sends adjusted quote] --> AdjustApi[/api/admin/quotes/[id]/send-adjusted-quote/]
    AdjustApi --> AdjustEmail[Send adjusted quote email]

    Webhook[Asaas paid webhook] --> WebhookApi[/api/payments/boleto/webhook/]
    WebhookApi --> PaidEmail[Send payment confirmation email]
